      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2012 Mosby, Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We evaluated pediatric obesity clinics for internal referrals developed at 5 primary care offices. Clinics developed site-specific strategies: 1 group approach and 4 clinics providing individualized care only. Clinicians reported patient/family motivation as an important referral consideration and compliance as the greatest challenge and perceive clinics to have provided some help."
      },
